window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>All I did was try to save my best friend from making a huge mistake....</b><br> <br> And now I'm saddled with an obnoxious werewolf who thinks I'm his wolfy wife.<br> <br> Did I mention that he's trapped in his wolf form until he believes I'm ready to say \"I do\"?<br> <br> Not exactly my idea of a good time.<br> <br> The wolf follows me everywhere, no matter how many times I escape him.<br> <br> No amount of running has shaken him from my tail.<br> <br> At this point, I have no option but to ask him to bite me, so I can move on with my life.<br> <br> All I can do now is hope for the best...which for me, is a female wolf who doesn't tie me down to the jerk who won't quit following me.<br> <br> <i>This stand-alone new-adult paranormal romance features sarcasm, humor, and an epic love story. Recommended for listeners 17+.</i></p>"; 
